neptech.machine.overkill_combustion_engine.tooltip.boost_regular=Supply §f1 L/s§7 of Cryotheum to produce up to §f%s EU/t§7 at §f2x§7 fuel consumption.
neptech.multiblock.large_combustion_engine.cryotheum_boost_disallowed=Upgrade the Dynamo Hatch to enable Cryotheum Boosting.
