neptech.parallels=Parallels: %s
neptech.processing_speed=Processing Speed: %s%%
neptech.energy_discount=Energy Usage: %s%%
neptech.hellish_ebf.oc.tip=This multiblock uses the same Heating Coil bonuses as the Electric Blast Furnace. Every voltage tier above MV increases temperature by 200K.
neptech.electric_implosion_compressor.parallels=Starts with 8 Parallels, and every tier above ZPM multiplies the parallels by 8

neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip1=The minimum size is 5x5x5, with the maximum being 25x25x25.
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip2=The Length, Width, and Height of the entire multiblock must be equal and odd.
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip3=The processing speed of the multiblock will get worse the larger you make it.
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip4=However, making the multiblock larger exponentially increases the parallels, the most being 4,194,304 parallels.
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip5=You can calculate the processing speed by measuring the distance from the controller to the edge, substracting 1, then multiplying by 100. The lowest it will go is -1000%% processing speed
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip6=You can use higher tier mixing modules to mitigate the processing speed debuff, however it gets more expensive the larger the multiblock is
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip7=Parallels are calculated by taking 4 to the power of the distance from the controller to the edge minus 1.
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip8=If you have UV tier or higher Mixing Modules, you can use a single Laser Hatch, though not in conjuction with regular Energy Hatches!
neptech.mixing_vessel.tooltip9=Happy mixing!

